17744&reg=3&lang=2", "publisherText": "Ministry of MSME Schemes Booklet 2025-26", "type": "official_booklet", "isPrimary": true}, {"id": "SCH000286-SRC003", "name": "Official Source", "url": "https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleaseIframePage.aspx?PRID=2004223&reg=48&lang=2", "publisherText": "Government of India", "type": "official_portal", "isPrimary": false}], "schemeUrl": "https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleseDetailm.aspx?PRID=2117744&reg=3&lang=2"}, "relationships": {"references": []}, "localization": {"en": {"name": "Pradhan Mantri Matsya Kisan Samridhi Sah-Yojana (PM-MKSSY)", "shortName": "PM-MKSSY", "summary": "Central sector sub-scheme under PMMSY for formalising fisheries micro and small enterprises, FY 2023-24 to 2026-27, outlay ₹6,000 crore.", "description": "Central sector sub-scheme under PMMSY for formalising fisheries micro and small enterprises, FY 2023-24 to 2026-27, outlay ₹6,000 crore. Creates the National Fisheries Digital Platform (NFDP) giving work-based digital identities to fishers and enterprises.", "objective": "Creates the National Fisheries Digital Platform (NFDP) giving work-based digital identities to fishers and enterprises.", "eligibilityText": "Fishers, fish farmers, fish workers, fish vendors and others directly in the fisheries value chain. Micro and small enterprises (proprietary, partnership, companies, LLPs), cooperatives, SHGs, FFPOs and startups in fisheries.", "benefitsText": "Aquaculture insurance: one-time incentive of 40% of premium, ceiling ₹25,000 per ha, max ₹1,00,000 per farmer (up to 4 ha), one crop cycle; extra 10% for SC, ST and women. Performance grant for micro enterprises: 25% of investment or ₹35 lakh (SC/ST/women: 35% or ₹45 lakh), whichever lower. Performance grant for small enterprises: 25% or ₹75 lakh (SC/ST/women: 35% or ₹100 lakh), whichever lower. Cooperatives/FFPOs/village organisations: 35% of investment or ₹200 lakh, whichever lower.", "applicationText": "Self-register on the National Fisheries Digital Platform (NFDP) to get a work-based digital identity. Apply for insurance incentive / performance grant through NFDP as per component."}, "ta": {"name": null, "shortName": null, "summary": null, "description": null, "objective": null, "eligibilityText": null, "benefitsText": null, "applicationText": null}, "hi": {"name": "प्रधानमंत्री मत्स्य किसान समृद्धि सह-योजना", "shortName": null, "summary": "पीएमएमएसवाई के अंतर्गत मत्स्य सूक्ष्म एवं लघु उद्यमों के औपचारिकीकरण हेतु केंद्रीय क्षेत्र उप-योजना, वित्त वर्ष 2023-24 से 2026-27, परिव्यय ₹6,000 करोड़।", "description": "पीएमएमएसवाई के अंतर्गत मत्स्य सूक्ष्म एवं लघु उद्यमों के औपचारिकीकरण हेतु केंद्रीय क्षेत्र उप-योजना, वित्त वर्ष 2023-24 से 2026-27, परिव्यय ₹6,000 करोड़। राष्ट्रीय मत्स्य डिजिटल प्लेटफॉर्म (एनएफडीपी) द्वारा मछुआरों और उद्यमों को कार्य-आधारित डिजिटल पहचान।", "objective": "पीएमएमएसवाई के अंतर्गत मत्स्य सूक्ष्म एवं लघु उद्यमों के औपचारिकीकरण हेतु केंद्रीय क्षेत्र उप-योजना, वित्त वर्ष 2023-24 से 2026-27, परिव्यय ₹6,000 करोड़।", "eligibilityText": "मछुआरे, मत्स्य किसान, मत्स्य श्रमिक, मछली विक्रेता तथा मत्स्य मूल्य श्रृंखला से सीधे जुड़े अन्य लोग। मत्स्य क्षेत्र के सूक्ष्म एवं लघु उद्यम (स्वामित्व, साझेदारी, कंपनी, एलएलपी), सहकारी समितियां, स्वयं सहायता समूह, एफएफपीओ और स्टार्टअप।", "benefitsText": "जलकृषि बीमा: प्रीमियम का 40% एकमुश्त प्रोत्साहन, ₹25,000 प्रति हेक्टेयर सीमा, प्रति किसान अधिकतम ₹1,00,000 (4 हेक्टेयर तक), एक फसल चक्र; अजा, अजजा और महिलाओं हेतु अतिरिक्त 10%। सूक्ष्म उद्यमों हेतु प्रदर्शन अनुदान: निवेश का 25% या ₹35 लाख (अजा/अजजा/महिला: 35% या ₹45 लाख), जो कम हो। लघु उद्यमों हेतु: 25% या ₹75 लाख (अजा/अजजा/महिला: 35% या ₹100 लाख), जो कम हो। सहकारी समितियां/मत्स्य किसान उत्पादक संगठन/ग्राम संगठन: निवेश का 35% या ₹200 लाख, जो कम हो।", "applicationText": "कार्य-आधारित डिजिटल पहचान हेतु राष्ट्रीय मत्स्य डिजिटल प्लेटफॉर्म (एनएफडीपी) पर स्वयं पंजीकरण करें। घटक अनुसार एनएफडीपी के माध्यम से बीमा प्रोत्साहन/प्रदर्शन अनुदान हेतु आवेदन करें।"}}, "search": {"aliases": {"en": ["Pradhan Mantri Matsya Kisan Samridhi Sah-Yojana (PM-MKSSY)", "PM-MKSSY"], "ta": [], "hi": ["प्रधानमंत्री मत्स्य किसान समृद्धि सह-योजना"]}, "keywords": {"en": ["pradhan", "mantri", "matsya", "kisan", "samridhi", "yojana", "mkssy"], "ta": [], "hi": []}, "synonyms": []}, "verification": {"status": "verified", "confidence": "high", "verifiedAt": "2026-10-04", "verifiedAgainst": ["SCH000286-SRC001"], "verifiedFields": [{"field": "content.schemeUrl", "value": "https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleseDetailm.aspx?PRID=2117744&reg=3&lang=2", "sourceTier": 5, "url": "https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleseDetailm.aspx?PRID=2117744&reg=3&lang=2", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-04", "outcome": "confirmed", "note": "Official scheme portal"}], "disputedFields": [], "missingFields": [], "notes": "Sub-scheme period FY 2023-24 to 2026-27.; NFDP URL not reachable for verification (nfdp.dahd.gov.in DNS failure); left null.; Application step 2 wording generalised; exact process not in source.; Sector ''fisheries'' not in vocabulary; mapped to agriculture.; [agent_flag] NFDP URL not reachable for verification (nfdp.dahd.gov.in DNS failure); left null.; [agent_flag] Application step 2 wording generalised; exact process not in source.; [agent_flag] Sector ''fisheries'' not in vocabulary; mapped to agriculture."}, "provenance": {"pipelineVersion": "catalog-v3-1-migration", "transformationNotes": ["Migrated from mss_scheme_data_v3_1 (ID: NEW2026-058)", "Action: ADD_NEW"], "translations": {"ta": {"status": "none", "reviewRequired": true, "engine": "none", "note": "Tamil translation pending"}, "hi": {"status": "machine", "reviewRequired": true, "source": "booklet_2025_26_machine_hi", "generatedAt": "2026-10-04T00:00:00Z"}}}, "metadata": {"catalogVersion": "1.35.0-alpha", "revision": 1, "schemaVersion": "1.0.0", "createdAt": "2026-10-04T13:50:15Z", "updatedAt": "2026-10-04T13:50:15Z"}}'::jsonb,
