oints. Supports post-harvest management, storage, processing, value addition and farm-gate infrastructure; PM-KUSUM components B and C also eligible. ₹80,224.15 crore sanctioned for 1,50,431 projects till 26.01.2026.", "objective": "Supports post-harvest management, storage, processing, value addition and farm-gate infrastructure; PM-KUSUM components B and C also eligible.", "eligibilityText": "Farmers, agri-entrepreneurs, FPOs, agri start-ups, PACS, SHGs, JLGs, cooperatives, APMCs and state agencies.", "benefitsText": "3% per annum interest subvention on loans from banks and financial institutions. Credit guarantee coverage for loans up to ₹2 crore under CGTMSE.", "applicationText": "Apply online on the AIF portal (single window with lending institutions) with the project report. Loan is sanctioned by the participating bank; interest subvention and guarantee are applied."}, "ta": {"name": null, "shortName": null, "summary": null, "description": null, "objective": null, "eligibilityText": null, "benefitsText": null, "applicationText": null}, "hi": {"name": "कृषि अवसंरचना कोष", "shortName": null, "summary": "फार्म-गेट और एकत्रीकरण केंद्रों पर कृषि अवसंरचना हेतु ₹1 लाख करोड़ की वित्तपोषण सुविधा।", "description": "फार्म-गेट और एकत्रीकरण केंद्रों पर कृषि अवसंरचना हेतु ₹1 लाख करोड़ की वित्तपोषण सुविधा। कटाई-उपरांत प्रबंधन, भंडारण, प्रसंस्करण, मूल्य संवर्धन और फार्म-गेट अवसंरचना; पीएम-कुसुम घटक ख और ग भी पात्र। 26.01.2026 तक 1,50,431 परियोजनाओं हेतु ₹80,224.15 करोड़ स्वीकृत।", "objective": "फार्म-गेट और एकत्रीकरण केंद्रों पर कृषि अवसंरचना हेतु ₹1 लाख करोड़ की वित्तपोषण सुविधा।", "eligibilityText": "किसान, कृषि उद्यमी, एफपीओ, कृषि स्टार्टअप, पैक्स, स्वयं सहायता समूह, संयुक्त देयता समूह, सहकारी समितियां, एपीएमसी और राज्य एजेंसियां।", "benefitsText": "बैंकों और वित्तीय संस्थाओं के ऋण पर 3% प्रति वर्ष ब्याज अनुदान। सीजीटीएमएसई के अंतर्गत ₹2 करोड़ तक के ऋण पर ऋण गारंटी।", "applicationText": "परियोजना रिपोर्ट के साथ एआईएफ पोर्टल (ऋणदाता संस्थाओं के साथ एकल खिड़की) पर ऑनलाइन आवेदन करें। सहभागी बैंक ऋण स्वीकृत करता है; ब्याज अनुदान और गारंटी लागू होती है।"}}, "search": {"aliases": {"en": ["Agriculture Infrastructure Fund (AIF)", "AIF"], "ta": [], "hi": ["कृषि अवसंरचना कोष"]}, "keywords": {"en": ["agriculture", "infrastructure", "fund"], "ta": [], "hi": []}, "synonyms": []}, "verification": {"status": "verified", "confidence": "high", "verifiedAt": "2026-10-04", "verifiedAgainst": ["SCH000287-SRC001"], "verifiedFields": [{"field": "content.schemeUrl", "value": "https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleasePage.aspx?PRID=2222807&reg=3&lang=1", "sourceTier": 5, "url": "https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleasePage.aspx?PRID=2222807&reg=3&lang=1", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-04", "outcome": "confirmed", "note": "Official scheme portal"}], "disputedFields": [], "missingFields": [], "notes": "Loans continue to be sanctioned (PIB Jan 2026).; Scheme end date (reported extension to 2032-33) not verified on fetched page.; ''Detailed project report'' document inferred, not quoted.; [agent_flag] Scheme end date (reported extension to 2032-33) not verified on fetched page.; [agent_flag] ''Detailed project report'' document inferred, not quoted."}, "provenance": {"pipelineVersion": "catalog-v3-1-migration", "transformationNotes": ["Migrated from mss_scheme_data_v3_1 (ID: NEW2026-059)", "Action: ADD_NEW"], "translations": {"ta": {"status": "none", "reviewRequired": true, "engine": "none", "note": "Tamil translation pending"}, "hi": {"status": "machine", "reviewRequired": true, "source": "booklet_2025_26_machine_hi", "generatedAt": "2026-10-04T00:00:00Z"}}}, "metadata": {"catalogVersion": "1.35.0-alpha", "revision": 1, "schemaVersion": "1.0.0", "createdAt": "2026-10-04T13:50:15Z", "updatedAt": "2026-10-04T13:50:15Z"}}'::jsonb,
