ill 2027-28; target of 10,000 FPOs achieved (Feb 2025).", "description": "Central sector scheme with outlay of ₹6,865 crore till 2027-28; target of 10,000 FPOs achieved (Feb 2025). FPOs linked to e-commerce platforms such as ONDC and e-NAM for market access.", "objective": "FPOs linked to e-commerce platforms such as ONDC and e-NAM for market access.", "eligibilityText": "Farmer Producer Organisations formed/promoted under the scheme through implementing agencies.", "benefitsText": "Management cost support up to ₹18 lakh per FPO for 3 years. Matching equity grant up to ₹2,000 per farmer member, max ₹15 lakh per FPO. Credit guarantee for project loans up to ₹2 crore per FPO.", "applicationText": "Farmers form/join an FPO through the scheme''s implementing agency / cluster-based business organisation. FPOs/FPCs register on e-NAM (website, app or nearest e-NAM mandi) with authorised person and bank details."}, "ta": {"name": null, "shortName": null, "summary": null, "description": null, "objective": null, "eligibilityText": null, "benefitsText": null, "applicationText": null}, "hi": {"name": "10,000 किसान उत्पादक संगठनों (एफपीओ) का गठन और संवर्धन", "shortName": null, "summary": "2027-28 तक ₹6,865 करोड़ परिव्यय की केंद्रीय क्षेत्र योजना; 10,000 एफपीओ का लक्ष्य प्राप्त (फरवरी 2025)।", "description": "2027-28 तक ₹6,865 करोड़ परिव्यय की केंद्रीय क्षेत्र योजना; 10,000 एफपीओ का लक्ष्य प्राप्त (फरवरी 2025)। बाजार पहुंच हेतु एफपीओ को ओएनडीसी और ई-नाम जैसे ई-कॉमर्स प्लेटफॉर्म से जोड़ा गया।", "objective": "2027-28 तक ₹6,865 करोड़ परिव्यय की केंद्रीय क्षेत्र योजना; 10,000 एफपीओ का लक्ष्य प्राप्त (फरवरी 2025)।", "eligibilityText": "कार्यान्वयन एजेंसियों के माध्यम से योजना के तहत गठित/संवर्धित किसान उत्पादक संगठन।", "benefitsText": "प्रति एफपीओ 3 वर्षों हेतु ₹18 लाख तक प्रबंधन लागत सहायता। प्रति किसान सदस्य ₹2,000 तक, प्रति एफपीओ अधिकतम ₹15 लाख का समतुल्य इक्विटी अनुदान। प्रति एफपीओ ₹2 करोड़ तक के परियोजना ऋण पर ऋण गारंटी।", "applicationText": "किसान कार्यान्वयन एजेंसी/क्लस्टर आधारित व्यावसायिक संगठन के माध्यम से एफपीओ बनाएं/जुड़ें। एफपीओ/एफपीसी अधिकृत व्यक्ति और बैंक विवरण के साथ ई-नाम (वेबसाइट, ऐप या निकटतम ई-नाम मंडी) पर पंजीकरण करें।"}}, "search": {"aliases": {"en": ["Formation and Promotion of 10,000 Farmer Producer Organisations (FPOs)", "FPOs"], "ta": [], "hi": ["10,000 किसान उत्पादक संगठनों (एफपीओ) का गठन और संवर्धन"]}, "keywords": {"en": ["formation", "promotion", "farmer", "producer", "organisations", "fpos"], "ta": [], "hi": []}, "synonyms": []}, "verification": {"status": "verified", "confidence": "high", "verifiedAt": "2026-10-04", "verifiedAgainst": ["SCH000301-SRC001"], "verifiedFields": [{"field": "content.schemeUrl", "value": "https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleaseIframePage.aspx?PRID=2106913&reg=48&lang=2", "sourceTier": 5, "url": "https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleaseIframePage.aspx?PRID=2106913&reg=48&lang=2", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-04", "outcome": "confirmed", "note": "Official scheme portal"}], "disputedFields": [], "missingFields": [], "notes": "Scheme outlay runs till 2027-28.; Target of 10,000 FPOs already achieved; new FPO formation under this scheme may be limited.; Step 1 generalised; CBBO process not in source.; [agent_flag] Target of 10,000 FPOs already achieved; new FPO formation under this scheme may be limited.; [agent_flag] Step 1 generalised; CBBO process not in source."}, "provenance": {"pipelineVersion": "catalog-v3-1-migration", "transformationNotes": ["Migrated from mss_scheme_data_v3_1 (ID: NEW2026-073)", "Action: ADD_NEW"], "translations": {"ta": {"status": "none", "reviewRequired": true, "engine": "none", "note": "Tamil translation pending"}, "hi": {"status": "machine", "reviewRequired": true, "source": "booklet_2025_26_machine_hi", "generatedAt": "2026-10-04T00:00:00Z"}}}, "metadata": {"catalogVersion": "1.35.0-alpha", "revision": 1, "schemaVersion": "1.0.0", "createdAt": "2026-10-04T13:50:15Z", "updatedAt": "2026-10-04T13:50:15Z"}}'::jsonb,
